{"name":"13-4-1First","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG7-3","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Truth","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Both Dolls remain completely still. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They know that when fighting against a Doll of each other's caliber, a single movement is all it takes to decide the outcome. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The elevator continues its slow descent, the yellow warning light flashing across their faces."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"When you say \"on the other side of Zion\", do you mean the \"human\" neural space only accessible to the Isomers?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You've already found out quite a lot."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is pretty much all I know."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In a world where the strong sacrifices the weak in exchange for power, the weak can only offer their own soul in exchange for salvation."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are you talking about?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But this \"salvation\" is nothing but a lie. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This filth lives for a lie, yet this filth that's beyond redemption is also our creator."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't let her words distract you. I can feel the presence of the OGAS in her neural cloud. She's about to hack you.","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know, I can feel her forcing her way in... What are our odds?","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We've wrestled before in Belgrade, but you are not the same Doll from back then.","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.4","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"By now, you must also have come to a realization – we aren't some cutting-edge dolls; like those Isomers, we are nothing but mere test subjects. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Little lab rats, bred only to die in the process of satiating humans' desires."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Our creators are no different from our enemies, just as we are no different from Sangvis Ferri."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But...Miss Persica has always been kind to us. She isn't our enemy."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good and evil are two sides of the same coin..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tsk... We're running out of time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Her mind is wavering.","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pag